-# "Nie masz konta? Zarejestruj się" — shared by every auth entry screen
-# (login, login-mail, and register/register-mail once they exist). An inert
-# button, deliberately: there is no registration flow yet, and a dead `href`
-# is the bug this replaced (see auth_smoke_test.rb).
%p.gh-auth-alt-action
  Nie masz konta?
  %button.gh-link-button{ type: 'button' } Zarejestruj się
